# Illogical Impulse — bat config (installed-user skel default).
#
# UNOWNED seam: upstream ships no ~/.config/bat, so this static default can
# never collide with or be wiped by upstream's rsync --delete. It only selects a
# dark theme that harmonizes with the Catppuccin-Mocha cold-start palette;
# "Catppuccin Mocha" is used when present (bat cache built), else the bundled
# "Coldark-Dark" via the documented fallback below. Delete ~/.config/bat to fall
# back to bat's own default theme.
--theme="Catppuccin Mocha"
--theme-dark="Catppuccin Mocha"
--style="numbers,changes,header"
--italic-text=always
--paging=auto
